{"id":"vod_sn_36758","vodId":"36758","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"软式网球社","name_cn":"软式网球社","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/4c76343fdd1e36c297aed391dad3f1c7.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在白玉中学之中，懒懒散散的三岛木洋（松本忍 配音）是软网社的顾问，虽然表面看来其貌不扬，但实际上，他曾经是获得过全国冠军的天才击球手。伊丽莎白（矢作纱友里 配音）是来自英国的留学生，曾因为三岛的影响而选择走上了网球的道路，如今，她作为留学生追随三岛来到了白玉中学。 活泼开朗的春风明日菜（伊藤加奈惠 配音）、对运动有着满腔热血的泽夏琴音（喜多村英梨 配音）、柔情似水温文尔雅的秋山千岁（伊藤静 配音）、拥有健康肤色沉默寡言的冬川来栖（明坂聪美 配音），在这些可爱社员的围绕下，三岛的日常就此拉开了序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:45:53","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0KnSPzveRt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/s7VrmYUcYK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jazAb3v9xw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Q2VRvd7pev1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qME8LpCU0U1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KMBPE09RVY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WKcYLWLwCp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gGfdZA5u7r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Kh38nPWaJ41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KJzTJP7E1L1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WcSmYSTbJb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qZVWYZXC8N1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:19.054Z"}